// The nine Litanies (Devotion, cast with a reliquary). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md,
// "Litanies (Devotion, reliquary)", and docs/game/03-combat.md, "Spells". Schema:
// crates/content/src/spells.rs, the same as formulae.ron. Each spell carries its own cast
// moves, projectiles, and buffs; the loader merges them into the move, projectile, and buff
// tables. FP costs are the moves' `fp`, except a channel, which pays per interval.
//
// Registry numbers: spells 15020-15028, moves 15150-15189, projectiles 15350-15369, and buffs
// 15450-15469 (the Litanies' halves of the blocks WP-055 started).
//
// Every number marked "tuning" is a first guess; the spec gives the FP cost, slots,
// requirement, and effect of each Litany. Where the spec leaves a number out (a buff's
// duration, an element's share of the hit), the value is marked too.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
(
  spells: [
    (
